> f(x: u8) = x>>x
> domain f
domain of f:
  x: u8, 0..255
  requires 0 <= x < 8  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)
  defined at 8 of 256 points
  defined for: 0..7
  undefined e.g. at x=8; x=9; x=10; x=11
  C undefined behaviour at 248 points, e.g. x=8
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  0..0   (1 distinct values)
  values: 0
  fits in u1
  undefined at 248 points
  over all 256 points of the domain
> wrap f
wrap analysis of f:
  no wrapping or rounding operations
  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 56 points, e.g. x=8
